{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare an unapproved reusable draft; no execution."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved class-22 pure-logic component. frames is a raw list of 0..2 objects, each with exactly toggles (a list of 0..2 exact bools including False). A helper receives the whole inputs mapping to distinguish absent from explicit null. Missing/null/wrong shapes/extra fields/numeric bools invalid. result={ok:boolean, frames:original if valid else []}. No imports/host/exceptions/coercion. Unapproved target-input draft; no execution, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-fresh-nested-bools", "description": "frames raw list length 0..2; each object has exactly toggles, itself list length 0..2 of exact bools including False. Missing/null/wrong shapes/extra fields/numeric bools invalid. result={ok:boolean, frames:original if valid else []}. No imports/host/exceptions/coercion. Unapproved target-input draft; selected-runner support, Q1 and human Q2 remain prerequisites.", "content": "def inspect_frames(mapping):
    if 'frames' not in mapping:
        return {'ok': False, 'frames': None}
    frames = mapping['frames']
    if frames is None:
        return {'ok': False, 'frames': None}
    if type(frames) is not list:
        return {'ok': False, 'frames': None}
    valid = len(frames) <= 2
    if valid:
        for frame in frames:
            if type(frame) is not dict or set(frame) != {'toggles'}:
                valid = False
                break
            toggles = frame['toggles']
            if not (type(toggles) is list and 0 <= len(toggles) <= 2):
                valid = False
                break
            for toggle in toggles:
                if type(toggle) is not bool:
                    valid = False
                    break
            if not valid:
                break
    return {'ok': valid, 'frames': frames if valid else []}"}}], "proposed_intent_examples": [], "proposed_recipe_updates": [], "settings_adjustments": []}
